            "title": "Choose the records that form lines",
            "detail": "The one definition every line count shares (lib/treatment-lines.ts): treatment records whose class is systemic therapy (chemo, chemotherapy, immuno, immunotherapy, immunotherapy (including vaccines), vaccine, targeted, targeted therapy, targeted molecular therapy, targeted antibody therapy, hormone, hormone therapy, hormonal therapy, biologic, investigational, systemic therapy, medical therapy, pharmaceutical therapy, nos). A record's class is its SUBTYPE, or its TREATMENT_TYPE where it has none; names and values match ignoring case.",
